        <headline>Dense Fog Advisory issued September 24 at 12:20AM MDT until September 24 at 10:00AM MDT by NWS Glasgow MT</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Visibility one quarter mile or less in dense fog.

* WHERE...Daniels, Dawson, Roosevelt, Richland, Sheridan, Roosevelt,
and Wibaux Counties.

* WHEN...Until 10 AM MDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Low visibility could make driving conditions hazardous.
</description>
        <instruction>If driving, slow down, use your headlights, and leave plenty of
distance ahead of you.</instruction>
